{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國女星宋慧喬本月22日度過45歲生辰，她昨晚透過社交網公開早前慶生的照片，寫道：「上個生日周，多謝所有人。</p><p>」相中宋慧喬捧住生日蛋糕，她特別附上「多謝媽咪」的字句，似乎是在家中與母親一起慶生的照片，而另一張照片中她捧住多束鮮花，與造型師好友</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T03:23:49.849490+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T03:05:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T03:17:13.527548+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T03:17:13.527548+00:00","content_hash":"7343c10abecd7b798dadec9735b62b8841041c68c845c346bbb6f6d97eacdd37","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}